WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,880
If you have a salary, you still have to take care of the food.

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,460
Start construction so soon

3
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:07,060
Where did you get so much money?

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,540
Purchasing makes a little difference

5
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:10,220
Common sense has advanced wages again

6
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,200
Living in a cave all the time is not a problem

7
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,680
Which girl is willing to marry if there is no house?

8
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:18,970
act within one's ability

9
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,040
Don't push yourself too hard

10
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:29,200
I know it well

11
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:31,360
Really building a house?

12
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,300
Five main rooms with small courtyard

13
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:34,940
Grandpa Sun does carpentry

14
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,220
Brother Qi Mo and Lao Si will come to hunt chickens tomorrow.

15
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:42,890
After dinner, I'll go to the city

16
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:45,170
Entering the city so late at night

17
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:46,730
Make an appointment with Section Chief Gao for delivery

18
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:48,210
Pull bricks and cement by the way

19
00:00:48,530 --> 00:00:49,770
The factory borrowed an old tricycle

20
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,170
If you can't finish it in one trip, make more trips.

21
00:00:51,170 --> 00:00:54,450
Be careful when walking on mountain roads at night. It's okay to take the girl with you.
